Root cause:
The bug was caused by a logic error introduced in commit 27c11b6b844c, which incorrectly prevented rewrites when the rewrite value matched the matched value. This led to a situation where rewrites were also skipped if the field was not matched, resulting in unintended behavior in the network driver. The patch corrects this by ensuring that rewrites are applied even when the field is not matched, as long as the rewrite value is different from the matched value.
